                        /** @description The whole table, replacing what is stored — except the rules the platform wrote itself when a page or a collection was renamed, which are kept unless your list claims the same `from`. Renaming a collection moves one address — its hub, `/c/<slug>` — and we write that rule for you; the pages filed under it are addressed by their own slug within the space and do not move. */
